      "title": "社会责任",
      "path": "/Users/liusuyao/code/python_code/IS/ESG-agent/RAG-2.0/materials/01681/02d9eecae3f993.html",
      "sha256": "58cd4ef5c52708cb2ab5f7c2998b2c8f304346b4148bced5c704556dcba1219a",
